      "finding_type": "legal",
      "summary": "Anatoly Golubchik pled guilty to RICO conspiracy (Count 1) in US v. Tokhtakhounov, 1:13-cr-00268 (SDNY) on Nov 15, 2013. Sentenced to 5 years (60 months) by Judge Jesse Furman on April 29, 2014. Principal leader of the Taiwanchik-Trincher Organization, which ran international gambling/money laundering enterprise out of Trump Tower unit 63A. Ordered to forfeit over M in cash, investments, and real property. Organization laundered approx M from 2006-2012 through Cyprus shell companies.",
